SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Platrithias
LOCATION:Platrithias\, Ithaca\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's central 15 August liturgy is in Platrithias\, and the evening panigiri in its big square marks the unofficial end of the Ithacan summer: live band\, barbecues\, pop-up bars and dancing until dawn\, with the whole island and every returned emigrant there. Rooms in the north are full that week\; plan to sleep in Vathy and drive.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#platrithias-panigiri-of-the-dormition-platrithias
